 maritime disaster. You find yourself on a massive container ship wrecked against a rocky shore. Survive for 3 days in this short free experience, using everything unconventionally that you find on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866180/extras/e64f49924fca07d9bdde4dcee622ab60.avif?t=1786884879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866180/extras_big/e64f49924fca07d9bdde4dcee622ab60.avif?t=1786884879 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle unpredictable storms, hunt wild animals, construct shelter from the remnants of the ship. Take care of your hunger and thirst. Creatively will help to utilize resources found in containers to survive in mystical Bermuda triangle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866180/extras/c060b45fede4e691c75f19cfd3b9483d.avif?t=1786884879\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4866180/extras_big/c060b45fede4e691c75f19cfd3b9483d.webp?t=1786884879 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you stay alive on this extreme ship in the middle of the Pacific with pirates around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Take on the role of a castaway on a wrecked container ship. Survive for 3 days, battle storms, hunt animals, build shelter, and maintain your hunger and thirst, attempting to endure isolation and pirates in the middle of the Pacific. Can you stay alive?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, P